# short-description: Create an OTA-enabled SD card image for the Emcraft SLX-SOM
# long-description: The root file system alone, as an OSTree physical sysroot
# at 8 MiB. U-Boot boots from the NAND and keeps its environment on the card
# at 0xE0000-0xE4000, inside this image's first 8 MiB: write the MBR and the
# partition only.
part / --source otaimage --ondisk mmcblk --fstype=ext4 --align 8192
